message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Analyzing Banks Reviews — Şikayetvar ML Text Mining"
authors:
  - family-names: Albayrak
    given-names: Betül
repository-code: "https://github.com/BetulAlbayrak1999/Analyzing-Banks-Reviews-Sikayetvar-ML-Text-Mining"
abstract: >-
  Comparative text mining and machine learning analysis of online banking
  customer complaints from Şikayetvar for VakıfBank, İş Bankası, and Kuveyt Türk.
  The pipeline covers Turkish NLP preprocessing, LDA topic modeling,
  TF-IDF classification, and hypothesis-driven comparative evaluation.
keywords:
  - text mining
  - NLP
  - machine learning
  - LDA
  - TF-IDF
  - banking
  - customer complaints
  - Şikayetvar
  - Turkish
